@SimpleTaskrAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5005

### Register a user (set Jwt:SecretKey in the environment before starting the API)
POST {{SimpleTaskrAPI_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sample-user",
  "password": "a-long-example-password"
}

### Log in
POST {{SimpleTaskrAPI_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sample-user",
  "password": "a-long-example-password"
}

### Access a protected route (paste the accessToken from register/login)
@token = paste-access-token-here
GET {{SimpleTaskrAPI_HostAddress}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Protected routes reject requests without a bearer token
GET {{SimpleTaskrAPI_HostAddress}}/tasks
Accept: application/json
